img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2913554676.webp","tag":"动作","address":" 法国 / 美国","years":"1994","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2581177788.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511077583.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511068675.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p470981086.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511077965.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p511118051.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2408302602.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p974544416.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p630017633.webp\"]","descs":"里昂（让·雷诺饰）是名孤独的职业杀手，受人雇佣。一天，邻居家小姑娘马蒂尔达（纳塔丽·波特曼饰)敲开他的房门，要求在他那里暂避杀身之祸。原来邻居家的主人是警方缉毒组的眼线，只因贪污了一小包毒品而遭恶警（加里·奥德曼饰）杀害全家的惩罚。马蒂尔达得到里昂的留救，幸免于难，并留在里昂那里。里昂教小女孩使枪，她教里昂法文，两人关系日趋亲密，相处融洽。","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1ZDqrT6sHnk8219sku2quSg?pwd=tuqt\",\"size\":\"2.29\",\"date\":\"2025-09-01\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":412,"title":"功夫","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 动作片\n好于 99% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2219011938.webp","tag":"No.72豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆 / 中国香港","years":"2004","date":"2004-12-23(中国大陆/中国香港)、2015-01-15(中国大陆3D)、2004-09-14(多伦多电影节)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2543885202.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2454612947.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456722077.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2454612944.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456721520.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2219011938.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2223182105.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2043005781.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2244450388.webp\"]","descs":"1940年代的上海，自小受尽欺辱的街头混混阿星（周星驰）为了能出人头地，可谓窥见机会的缝隙就往里钻，今次他盯上行动日益猖獗的黑道势力“斧头帮”，想借之大名成就大业。\n　　阿星假冒“斧头帮”成员试图在一个叫“猪笼城寨”的地方对居民敲诈，不想引来真的“斧头帮”与“猪笼城寨”居民的恩怨。“猪笼城寨”原是藏龙卧虎之处，居民中有许多身怀绝技者（元华、梁小龙等），他们隐藏于此本是为远离江湖恩怨，不想麻烦自动上身，躲都躲不及。而在观战正邪两派的斗争中，阿星逐渐领悟功夫的真谛。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1I3vQCftTVMkjUr87ClwMlA?pwd=vkhq\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1217,"title":"罗拉快跑 Lola rennt","ratingNum":8.1,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 95% 动作片\n好于 94% 犯罪片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2574867081.webp","tag":"No.16|欧洲犯罪片榜","address":" 德国","years":"1998","date":"1998-08-20(德国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2574738011.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2918687183.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1174672094.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1174671984.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1174672767.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2574867081.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p514318558.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1004933401.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1004933139.webp\"]","descs":"罗拉（弗兰卡•波滕特 饰）和曼尼（莫里兹•克雷多 饰）是一对年轻的恋人，其中曼尼是一个不务正业的小混混，而罗拉则是相信“天大的事情有爱情顶着”的爱情至上主义者。\n　　一天，曼尼为老大完成一项钻石交易，带着装有10万马克的钱袋等候罗拉的接应，然而罗拉的自行车被人抢走，耽误了约定的接应时间，曼尼只好乘地铁回去。在地铁车厢里，曼尼扶起身边的乞丐，同时，看见两名警察向他走来。慌乱中，曼尼下了车，竟然把钱袋忘在了车厢里。显然，钱袋被乞丐拿走了。此时距离曼尼和老大约定见面交钱的时间只剩下20分钟，如果20分钟之内筹集不到10万马克，曼尼就会被老大杀死。走投无路的曼尼打电话向罗拉求救，如果罗拉20分钟之内不能赶到，曼尼只能铤而走险抢劫电话亭对面的超市。\n　　考验罗拉爱情的时候到了，为了在20分钟内筹到10万马克，救出曼尼，她狂奔在向银行家父亲求助的路上。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/14i3_KvjT5hnytS7DER5upg?pwd=b9ru\",\"size\":\"1.19\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1245,"title":"金刚 King Kong","ratingNum":8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 95% 动作片\n好于 93% 奇幻片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p858079649.webp","tag":"第78届奥斯卡金像奖获奖名单","address":" 新西兰 / 美国 / 德国","years":"2005","date":"2006-01-12(中国大陆)、2005-12-05(纽约首映)、2005-12-14(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459569895.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2057259438.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459571565.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459573304.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2057259610.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p858079649.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2177130090.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2885736824.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1340633047.webp\"]","descs":"导演率领拍摄组来到神秘的骷髅岛开始了一部电影的拍摄，女主角是漂亮娇小的安(娜奥米•沃茨 Naomi Watts 饰)，她在纽约的演艺事业陷入了低谷，这是她时来运转的大好机会。他们乘坐轮船来到岛上，却不知在岛上即将要险象横生。\n　　正当导演要开始开机拍摄时，他们遭到了当地土著的袭击，几个随行人员遇难身亡。摄制组慌忙逃离，幸好起航离去，却发现不见了女主角安。\n　　原来安土著野人抓走，被当作祭品。安尖声惊叫，引来了传说中骷髅岛的猩猩——金刚的关注。金刚在岛上很有霸气，连恐龙都要忌它几分。然而，野兽爱上了美人，金刚搭救安脱离困境，不料却让自己陷入了一场悲剧。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1bpyXEsxOW7ksmwvqbKKSpQ