89667011.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2538560188.webp\"]","descs":"在我们的孩子时代，不断升级的气候变化正在使世界经济翻天覆地。随着农作物的死亡和食品价格的飙升，食品已取代石油成为世界上最有价值的商品。在仅存的几块土地中，印尼正迅速崛起成为下一个经济超级大国，当时印尼政府突然被一个广受欢迎的流氓政党皮拉纳斯无情地取代。\n　　安加·萨普特拉，一位雄心勃勃的前海军陆战队议员，后来成为了皮拉纳斯的国会议员，他有一个主要的指示：控制人民的士气和服从，阻止任何可能激怒皮拉纳斯党的地下反叛组织。尤其是一个自称为“改革”的大集团。\n　　安加被迫与一个老对手维斯努（wisnu）联合作战，这个老对手是一个冷酷无情的准军事领导人。在这次行动中，一个单独的安哥拉被一组改革组织截获、俘获并拖到地下。但安加并没有遇到敌人，反而遇到了他所谓的死去的未婚妻，一位曾获奖的现场记者，萨里·尼尔马拉。在那里，安加了解到，该党一直在撒谎，并以牺牲自己人民的饥饿为... (展开全部)","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/17fgCrNXBr3b0zWHtAR9EiQ?pwd=hk2h\",\"size\":\"2.53\",\"date\":\"2025-08-08\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":false}]"},{"id":1239,"title":"恐龙谷","ratingNum":5,"ratingbetterthan":"","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2622015669.webp","tag":"科幻,动作,冒险","address":"","years":"1969","date":"","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p472480497.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p472479860.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p472479518.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p472479299.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2512148300.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2622015697.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2622015691.webp\"]","descs":"　　Cowboy James Franciscus seeks fame and fortune by capturing a Tyrannosaurus Rex living in the Forbidden Valley and putting it in a Mexican circus. His victim, called the Gwangi, turns out to have an aversion to being shown in public. Another film featuring the stop-action special effects talents of Ray Harryhausen.","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1cYb3nB82_lOimx91Lc-Rxg?pwd=4gs9\",\"size\":\"1.82\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"t